SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:(FREE FOOD!) NU Quizbowl Trivia Night
LOCATION:Parkes 122, Evanston, IL 60208, United States
URL:https://catsoncampus.northwestern.edu/rsvp?id=376637
DESCRIPTION:Please RSVP (https://forms.gle/PF3y9VabyxkY69SE6) so we know how many people to expect! We will welcome a few walk-ins but not everyone will be able to get food if we don't know how many people to expect.\n\nTrivia night hosted by Northwestern Quizbowl, covering a wide variety of academic topics. We will have food catered from La Cocinita for everyone, and ! This event is geared towards people with no experience in Quizbowl, but open to everyone regardless of prior experience! \n---\nEvent Details: https://catsoncampus.northwestern.edu/rsvp?id=376637
